# =============================================================================
# PACKAGE MANAGER FILES
# =============================================================================

# ----------------------------------------
# npm / yarn / pnpm
# ----------------------------------------
# Lock files - COMMIT for applications, IGNORE for libraries
# Uncomment the appropriate lines based on your project type:

# For APPLICATIONS (recommended: commit lock files):
# (Keep package-lock.json, yarn.lock, pnpm-lock.yaml committed)

# For LIBRARIES (recommended: ignore lock files):
# package-lock.json
# yarn.lock
# pnpm-lock.yaml

# ----------------------------------------
# Python
# ----------------------------------------
# Pipfile.lock - COMMIT for applications, IGNORE for libraries
# Uncomment for libraries:
# Pipfile.lock

# Poetry
poetry.lock  # COMMIT for applications

# ----------------------------------------
# Ruby
# ----------------------------------------
# Gemfile.lock - COMMIT for applications, IGNORE for gems

# ----------------------------------------
# PHP
# ----------------------------------------
composer.lock  # COMMIT for applications, IGNORE for libraries

